; error: 15:8: 'p' is given the place itself, to change, so it needs a place that can change, and 'p' is a 'bind&' parameter, which only reads the caller's place; to pass it on to be changed, write 'hold& p: Point'
shape Point
    x: int

    alters grow(fixed& by: Point)
        .x = .x + by.x
    fi
fi

task g(flex& p: Point)
    p.x = 1
fi

task f(fixed& p: Point)
    g(&p)
fi
